      "kind": "paragraph",
      "section": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ai_economics-block-2",
      "quote": "The cost model",
      "kind": "heading",
      "section": "The cost model"
    },
    {
      "id": "ai_economics-block-3",
      "quote": "The 6ND rule: training cost in one line",
      "kind": "heading",
      "section": "The 6ND rule: training cost in one line"
    },
    {
      "id": "ai_economics-block-4",
      "quote": "floating-point operations. The \"6\" has a clean origin, and it is worth deriving rather than memorizing:",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "section": "The 6ND rule: training cost in one line"
    },
    {
      "id": "ai_economics-block-5",
      "quote": "Price your training run Pick a model size, a data budget, a GPU, and an MFU. Watch the FLOPs, hours, and dollars move.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "section": "The 6ND rule: training cost in one line"
    },
    {
      "id": "ai_economics-block-6",
